## is read back through that markup, so it can sit inside or outside the colour.
## Title: |cFF69B4PB's Ember|r 0.1.1
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Ember, a tiny two-head-tall mascot, pops up on the game screen during a fight and tells you in a speech bubble when Major Resolve or Minor Resolve is about to run out and when your health falls low, with a little animation.
